This folder contains code from XReflection (https://github.com/hainuo-wang/XReflection),
commit 38512e1e9854a497122142d012fce01bfaa93b4d, by Mingjia Li, Hainuo Wang, Jiarui Wang,
Qiming Hu and Xiaojie Guo. The XReflection README states it is licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
(The repository does not ship a LICENSE file; the README links one.)

Files: dsit_arch.py (DSIT, "Single Image Reflection Separation via Interactive Dual-Stream Transformers",
NeurIPS 2024) and swin_det.py (Swin Transformer backbone, originally from Microsoft, MIT).
Modifications for glassfix are listed at the top of each file.

